t_{p}=1.25\\times 10^{5}{\\rm s}\\ \\left(\\frac{v_{\\rm ej}}{0.1c}\\right)^{-1/2} \\left(\\frac{M_{\\rm ej}}{10^{-2}M_{\\odot}}\\right)^{1/2}\\left(\\frac{\\kappa}{1~{ }{\\rm cm^{2}~{}g^{-1}}}\\right)^{1/2}. 

