\\nu_{p}\\sim 7.70\\times 10^{15}{\\rm Hz}\\ \\kappa^{-1/4}\\xi^{1/4}M_{\\rm ej,-3}^{ 1/4}B_{p,14}^{1/2}P_{0,-3}^{-1}R_{\\rm s,6}^{3/2}. 

The according peak flux could be given by

F_{\\nu_{p}}\\sim 1.03\\times 10^{7}\\mu{\\rm Jy}\\ \\kappa^{1/4}\\xi^{3/4}M_{\\rm ej,-3}^{1/4}B_{p,14}^{3/2}  \\times P_{0,-3}^{-3}R_{\\rm s,6}^{9/2}d_{26}^{-2}.

